{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "cleanUrls": true,
  "trailingSlash": false,
  "redirects": [
    {
      "_comment": "Enlaces antiguos a la ficha de una experiencia. Cada una tiene ahora su propia ruta (/reservas/<slug>) para ser indexable; el 301 traspasa lo que hubieran acumulado y evita que Google vea dos URL con el mismo contenido. Va antes que el rewrite: los redirects se resuelven primero.",
      "source": "/reservas",
      "has": [
        { "type": "query", "key": "actividad", "value": "(?<slug>.+)" }
      ],
      "destination": "/reservas/:slug",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "www.kaitenski.com" }],
      "destination": "https://kaitenski.com/$1",
      "permanent": true
    }
  ],
  "rewrites": [{ "source": "/(.*)", "destination": "/index.html" }],
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Strict-Transport-Security",
          "value": "max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains"
        },
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "SAMEORIGIN" },
        {
          "key": "Referrer-Policy",
          "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        },
        {
          "key": "Permissions-Policy",
          "value": "camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), usb=(), magnetometer=(), gyroscope=(), accelerometer=()"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/assets/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Tarjetas sociales por experiencia. Nombre estable (no llevan hash de Vite) porque las redes cachean la imagen por URL: una URL que cambiara en cada despliegue rompería lo ya compartido.",
      "source": "/og/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=604800" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(favicon.png|apple-touch-icon.png|og-image.png)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=86400" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(sitemap.xml|robots.txt)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=3600" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(index.html|nosotros|reservas|tarifas|niveles|faq|aviso-legal|terminos|privacidad|cookies)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
